ttps://scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491821178_1564701297892584_1032540183332829449_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=ah_LT-GBdkoQ7kNvwFo1vgr&_nc_oc=Adm7iXubvpZ9XqAsKSrUxnfGzSRy0zMxtAJ_u2wivZw-bEeTe7gbrSbM1uf2jV6LNvU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc6-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AftmMnDlZyJ-81EyYIvWWNQHPw8LiKqzjjzXTe89qO4C8w&oe=699850FA"}, {"file_name": "2026-01 - First Bloom - Screenshot 1.png", "id": "1179206614192114", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499303140_1179206617525447_6426718312682771437_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=7-WYxg5j17UQ7kNvwHR8GHq&_nc_oc=AdlO1SeZT61axzJA-tXy9618RNk3FO5smrsMkBBEiDqH8DHgNkJ3I2iXfLcanfyXXtk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afukt5-OLGoG0nHbi8Pddh09OLm1gKw1qlgjChgiBFKX_w&oe=69985E3D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Cover Art Landscape.png", "id": "2243816689452785", "uri": "https://scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499294650_2243816692786118_4170064839917832017_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=txJ3cW9NK2oQ7kNvwHxwKg8&_nc_oc=AdlfiyoJ92uUiPToFyixKoyj6XNTWdlGbjVPxRmWraff_Lz7A2X4jc3XJZYQ6pefELE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sjc3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfvIDicLjK2C8vjKtzC6kTxMl8KPKzx3LOWogPSQiIxUNw&oe=69984F7D"}, "display_name": "Tend with Friends", "keywords": ["garden", "cozy", "plants", "simulation", "relaxing"], "long_description": "**Tend with Friends** is your new, magical gardening experience. Grow a collection of curious, moody, and beautiful plants that need more than just water, they need you!\n\n# \ud83c\udf31 Watch Life Unfold\nWitness every leaf unfurl & flower bloom in real-time. Inspired by reality, our artists hand-crafted every frame of growth to make your plants feel truly alive.\n{1818206152197505}\n\n#  \ud83e\udde9  Blooms Take Time, Patience is the Best Fertilizer\nOur core belief is that every plant experience should spark joy. No plants die in **Tend with Friends**, they just might be moodier, shy, or extra demanding!\n{831540516427888}\n\n\n# \ud83d\udc4b Your World, Your Hands\nNo controllers needed. Using just your hands, place virtual pots right on your real coffee table or bookshelf.\n{860635716550743}\n\n\n# \ud83c\udfb6 Find Your Vibe\nCustomize your sanctuary with hand-painted backgrounds and a \"soundbath\" soundtrack to set the right mood.\n{1374563571035503}\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf3cStart Your Garden for Free\nDip your toes in the soil for free, featuring 5 unique plants and a collection of cozy decor.\n{2058767028232934}\n\n\n# \ud83c\udf3a Ready to grow more?\nThe **Founder's Collection** is available for those who want the full botanical experience: unlocking 10+ rare plants, new backgrounds, music, and exclusive designer pots.\n\n# Transform your world, one plant at a time.\n\ud83e\udeb4", "short_description": "Tend with Friends is a welcoming, magical gardening game for the creative and curious, offering a comfortable, seated MR experience where you solve beautiful 5-minute plant puzzles to turn your room into an enchanted garden. \ud83e\udeb4\n\nFeatures:\n- Real-time Animated Plant Growth \ud83e\udd40\n- Unique Needs to Solve for each Flower \ud83e\udde9\n- Multiple Pots for Plants \ud83e\udeb4\n- Crossbreeding to Discover \ud83c\udf38\n- Hand tracking & Controller support \ud83d\udc4b\n- Custom Soundtracks & Hand Painted Backgrounds \ud83c\udfa8\n\nYour garden is awaits."}]}, "developer_name": "Theory Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://tendwithfriends.com/privacy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Theory Studios", "support_website_url": "http://tendwithfriends.com/support", "website_url": "http://tendwithfriends.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "331529188132278"}], "external_s